{"id":"m3-u04","level":"m3","order":4,"title":{"en":"Environment","fr":"Environnement","es":"Medio ambiente","ar":"البيئة"},"tip":{"en":"Show cause with \"because\", \"because of\", \"since\" and \"as a result of\". Show effect with \"so\", \"therefore\", \"as a result\" and \"this leads to\". Note: \"because of\" is followed by a noun, \"because\" by a full clause.","fr":"Exprimez la cause avec « parce que », « à cause de », « puisque », et la conséquence avec « donc », « par conséquent », « cela entraîne ». Attention : « à cause de » est suivi d'un nom, « parce que » d'une proposition.","es":"Expresa la causa con «porque», «debido a», «ya que» y la consecuencia con «así que», «por lo tanto», «esto provoca». Ojo: «debido a» va seguido de un nombre; «porque», de una oración completa.","ar":"عبّر عن السبب بـ«لأن» و«بسبب» و«نظرا لـ» وعن النتيجة بـ«لذلك» و«ونتيجة لذلك» و«هذا يؤدي إلى». انتبه: «بسبب» يليها اسم، و«لأن» يليها جملة كاملة."},"words":43,"lessons":[{"id":"m3-u04-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"environment, climate, global warming","fr":"environnement, climat, réchauffement climatique","es":"medio ambiente, clima, calentamiento global","ar":"بيئة، مناخ، الاحترار العالمي"},"count":11},{"id":"m3-u04-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"recycling, energy, solar panel","fr":"recyclage, énergie, panneau solaire","es":"reciclaje, energía, panel solar","ar":"إعادة التدوير، طاقة، لوحة شمسية"},"count":10},{"id":"m3-u04-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"drought, flood, wildfire","fr":"sécheresse, inondation, incendie de forêt","es":"sequía, inundación, incendio forestal","ar":"جفاف، فيضان، حريق غابات"},"count":11},{"id":"m3-u04-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"ocean, glacier, resource","fr":"océan, glacier, ressource","es":"océano, glaciar, recurso","ar":"محيط، نهر جليدي، مورد"},"count":10},{"id":"m3-u04-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"effect, consequence, because of","fr":"effet, conséquence, à cause de","es":"efecto, consecuencia, debido a","ar":"أثر، عاقبة، بسبب"},"count":11},{"id":"m3-u04-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"due to, to lead to, to cause","fr":"en raison de, entraîner, causer","es":"a causa de, provocar, causar","ar":"نظرا لـ، أدى إلى، تسبب في"},"count":10},{"id":"m3-u04-l7","type":"learn","order":7,"title":{"en":"to reduce, to save, to recycle","fr":"réduire, économiser, recycler","es":"reducir, ahorrar, reciclar","ar":"قلل، وفر، أعاد تدوير"},"count":11},{"id":"m3-u04-l8","type":"learn","order":8,"title":{"en":"to rise, to die out, sustainable","fr":"augmenter, disparaître, durable","es":"aumentar, extinguirse, sostenible","ar":"ارتفع، انقرض، مستدام"},"count":9},{"id":"m3-u04-l9","type":"learn","order":9,"title":{"en":"harmful, endangered, urgent","fr":"nocif, menacé, urgent","es":"perjudicial, amenazado, urgente","ar":"ضار، مهدد، عاجل"},"count":10},{"id":"m3-u04-l10","type":"story","order":10,"title":{"en":"Conversation","fr":"Conversation","es":"Conversación","ar":"محادثة"},"count":10},{"id":"m3-u04-l11","type":"review","order":11,"title":{"en":"Unit review","fr":"Révision de l'unité","es":"Repaso de la unidad","ar":"مراجعة الوحدة"},"count":9}]}
